	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(80.0, 330.0, 540.0, 190.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">*Chapter 6. Same headlines and Bag of Words as Chapter 4. 6A: change the method in Test and Score. 6B: Parameter Fitter (number of trees); learner settings in Random Forest and Logistic Regression. 6C: Data Sampler 80/20 (tick stratify). In the second Test and Score, Data Sampler's Data Sample is the training data; connect its Remaining Data to the Test Data input yourself, then choose Test on test data.*</text>
	</annotations>
